{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3482","id":4526921079,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz888AAAABDdNVdw","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3482","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3482.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3482.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3482","number":3482,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix PTR/search domain generation for octet-aligned subnets","user":{"login":"MichaelGooden","id":1275012,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzUwMTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1275012?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGooden","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelGooden","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGooden/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGooden/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGooden/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGooden/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGooden/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGooden/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGooden/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGooden/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGooden/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The current implementation of MagicDNS search domain PTR generation for the tailnet subnet does not correctly cater for octet-aligned subnets (e.g. `172.16.0.0/16`). It currently generates 256 entries on byte aligned subnet masks: `172.16.0.0/16` creates ` [0-255].16.172.in-addr.arpa.`.\r\n\r\nWhile the current implementation is functionally correct in a vacuum, it creates an excessive amount of search domain entries, that at minimum, bust the limits of the `systemd-resolved` stub resolver (`resolved` supports 256 maximum entries, with the tailscale client trying to install 257+ search domains - the 256 PTRs and the MagicDNS domain itself when using an octet-aligned subnet).\r\n\r\nThis fix outputs a single search domain for all octet-aligned subnet masks (`/8`, `/16`, `/24`), with `172.16.0.0/16`  now outputting a single `16.172.in-addr.arpa.` entry.\r\n\r\nThis fixes implementation also replaces the `/32` special case workaround.\r\n\r\nNew tests have been added for both octet-aligned (including the `/32` special case) and -unaligned subnets. The existing test for `172.16.0.0/16` has been corrected for the expected single domain output, but could be removed entirely in lieu of the new tests.\r\n\r\nI believe this fix is suitable for backporting to the v0.29.x series.\r\n\r\n> - [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\r\n> - [ ] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\r\n> - [x] added unit tests\r\n> - [ ] added integration tests\r\n> - [ ] updated documentation if needed\r\n> - [x] updated CHANGELOG.md\r\n\r\n> An LLM was used for root cause analysis, suggested fix and human-directed code generation","created_at":"2026-09-14T13:32:57Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T09:29:49Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user